    "description": "This dataset contains water pressure, temperature, salinity, density, potential temperature, dissolved oxygen, chlorophyll, and turbidity from CTD taken from the Brazilian Navy research vessel Cruzeiro do Sul in the Southwest Atlantic Ocean from 2015-04-01 to 2015-05-08. The deployment plan of CTD stations was based on the evaluation of the most probable sites of the presence of the mode water. Data are in ASCII format.",
